<Layout title="Scavland updates and release watch | Scavland Wiki" description="Track Scavland release context, official announcements and the evidence changes that affect this guide site." canonical="/updates/"><section class="listing"><p class="eyebrow">Release watch</p><h1 class="page-title">Updates<br/><span style="color:var(--acid)">with receipts.</span></h1><div class="prose"><p>This page is intentionally compact until the Early Access build supplies patch notes and reproducible tests. We will record source date, build version and what changed before updating guides.</p><h2>Current baseline</h2><p>The Steam store and developer announcements are the official references for planned release timing and feature scope. Pre-release screenshots and videos are labelled community demonstrations where they do not establish a mechanic.</p><h2>What gets updated</h2><ul><li>Release date or platform facts from official sources.</li><li>Guide claims after a reproducible in-game test.</li><li>Maps, loot and recipes only after versioned captures.</li></ul></div></section></Layout>
